    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duo Heli Combat</strong> is a vibrant and dynamic voxel-based arcade game with strategy elements where you pilot a helicopter, complete missions, capture bases, and battle alone or with a friend in split-screen mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/e8515d001068e1238a98524306a752a5.poster.avif?t=1755714085\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/e8515d001068e1238a98524306a752a5.webm?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/e8515d001068e1238a98524306a752a5.mp4?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/97f9f7aadf83741ab65542c442dc38a9.poster.avif?t=1755714085\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/97f9f7aadf83741ab65542c442dc38a9.webm?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/97f9f7aadf83741ab65542c442dc38a9.mp4?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions - rescue prisoners, escort convoys, capture flags, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/bf363743c63c27f62c89acde7a612cd6.poster.avif?t=1755714085\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/bf363743c63c27f62c89acde7a612cd6.webm?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/bf363743c63c27f62c89acde7a612cd6.mp4?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/ccc65deee5c5e9871cfe7bcf17f2e3e4.poster.avif?t=1755714085\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/ccc65deee5c5e9871cfe7bcf17f2e3e4.webm?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/ccc65deee5c5e9871cfe7bcf17f2e3e4.mp4?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain map control - call in reinforcements to strengthen your battlefield dominance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/38eb0ccad5260f7f24a67f734804047e.poster.avif?t=1755714085\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/38eb0ccad5260f7f24a67f734804047e.webm?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/38eb0ccad5260f7f24a67f734804047e.mp4?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight solo or team up with a friend on one PC in Campaign mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience diverse gameplay mechanics in Co-op mode and share this amazing experience with a friend...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or challenge each other in Versus mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied arsenal: machine gun, rocket launcher, homing missiles, bombs;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapons and create your perfect combat loadout;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant pixel-art locations with minimalist graphics;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/f74792e383bf7e3bfd3ef73d5b35a3c5.poster.avif?t=1755714085\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/f74792e383bf7e3bfd3ef73d5b35a3c5.webm?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/f74792e383bf7e3bfd3ef73d5b35a3c5.mp4?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the pilot. Be the strategist. Command the helicopter. Command the battlefield!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duo Heli Combat</strong> is a vibrant and dynamic voxel-based arcade game with strategy elements where you pilot a helicopter, complete missions, capture bases, and battle alone or with a friend in split-screen mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/e8515d001068e1238a98524306a752a5.poster.avif?t=1755714085\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/e8515d001068e1238a98524306a752a5.webm?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/e8515d001068e1238a98524306a752a5.mp4?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/97f9f7aadf83741ab65542c442dc38a9.poster.avif?t=1755714085\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/97f9f7aadf83741ab65542c442dc38a9.webm?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/97f9f7aadf83741ab65542c442dc38a9.mp4?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions - rescue prisoners, escort convoys, capture flags, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/bf363743c63c27f62c89acde7a612cd6.poster.avif?t=1755714085\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/bf363743c63c27f62c89acde7a612cd6.webm?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/bf363743c63c27f62c89acde7a612cd6.mp4?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/ccc65deee5c5e9871cfe7bcf17f2e3e4.poster.avif?t=1755714085\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/ccc65deee5c5e9871cfe7bcf17f2e3e4.webm?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/ccc65deee5c5e9871cfe7bcf17f2e3e4.mp4?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain map control - call in reinforcements to strengthen your battlefield dominance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/38eb0ccad5260f7f24a67f734804047e.poster.avif?t=1755714085\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/38eb0ccad5260f7f24a67f734804047e.webm?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/38eb0ccad5260f7f24a67f734804047e.mp4?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight solo or team up with a friend on one PC in Campaign mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience diverse gameplay mechanics in Co-op mode and share this amazing experience with a friend...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or challenge each other in Versus mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied arsenal: machine gun, rocket launcher, homing missiles, bombs;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapons and create your perfect combat loadout;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant pixel-art locations with minimalist graphics;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/f74792e383bf7e3bfd3ef73d5b35a3c5.poster.avif?t=1755714085\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/f74792e383bf7e3bfd3ef73d5b35a3c5.webm?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648520/extras/f74792e383bf7e3bfd3ef73d5b35a3c5.mp4?t=1755714085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the pilot. Be the strategist. Command the helicopter. Command the battlefield!</strong></p>",
